# Chestnut Labs: normalize line endings to LF across platforms.
# Rationale: upstream CI runs on Ubuntu (LF) and Prettier is configured with endOfLine:lf.
# On Windows checkouts, core.autocrlf=true produced CRLF worktrees that failed `prettier --check`.
# Normalizing here keeps `npm run lint` green on every platform without touching file contents
# (the Git index was already LF). Recorded as a bootstrap hygiene change, not an inherited fix.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# G-code and fixtures are text; keep LF for stable hashing in the fixture manifest.
*.gcode text eol=lf
